<title>USA: Parker Drilling completes acquisitions.</title>
<headline>Parker Drilling completes acquisitions.</headline>
<dateline>TULSA, Okla. 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Parker Drilling Co said Tuesday it completed the acquisition of Mallard Bay Drilling Inc for $338 million and Quail Tools Inc for $65 million.</p>
<p>Mallard operates 40 drilling and workover barges in the Gulf of Mexico and Nigeria and seven platform rigs in the Gulf of Mexico and off the Peruvian coast, Parker Drilling said.</p>
<p>Mallard was purchased from Energy Ventures Inc.</p>
<p>Quail provides rental tools used in well drilling.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
